  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this contract is to streamline and optimise institutional framework, eliminate overlapping competences and ensure effective lines of accountability.The project will consist of two components:Component 1: Optimisation and rationalisation of the state administrative bodies and inspection services Component 2: Improvement of the framework of the discretionary powers</narrative>
  </description>
